SUMMARY:Kenya: Individual income tax returns due by end of fourth month
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming\, 1 Jan 2027. From 1 January 2027\, individual taxpaye
 rs will be required to file income tax returns by the last day of the four
 th month after the end of the year of income.\n\nSource: https://www.kra.g
 o.ke/finance-act-2026-what-it-means-for-you\nDetails: https://www.intellig
 entpayroll.eu/countries/kenya.html#ke-fa2026-return-deadline\n\nFor inform
 ation only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
